values.

00:03:45.439 --> 00:03:46.459
You can't argue with that.

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:50.830
If someone has a disagreement on tax policy
and they like Trump's tax policy, we might

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.909
be able to have a conversation.

00:03:52.909 --> 00:03:56.980
When someone is so diluted and disconnected
from reality, the arguments are a waste of

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.980
time.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.109
We're better off getting out the vote.

00:03:59.109 --> 00:04:03.389
We're better off finding people who are already
on our side but might not care enough to vote

00:04:03.389 --> 00:04:05.680
or might not think their vote is important.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.609
Those are the folks that we want to be going
after trying to change the minds of someone

00:04:10.609 --> 00:04:16.019
who loves Trump's family values or thinks
Trump is a better president than Lincoln.

00:04:16.019 --> 00:04:17.470
It's a waste of time.

